        "Although the app is useful, it",
        "may distract students in class."
      ],
      "audioText": "Although the app is useful, it may distract students in class.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n6-b2-consolidation-capstone-2"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n6.class-97.t02",
      "en": "The results suggest that teenagers sleep less than they need.",
      "es": "Los resultados sugieren que los adolescentes duermen menos de lo que necesitan.",
      "explanationEs": "Suggest es más prudente que prove: no afirmas más de lo que muestran los datos.",
      "segments": [
        "The results suggest that teenagers",
        "sleep less than they need."
      ],
      "audioText": "The results suggest that teenagers sleep less than they need.",
