      "patternId": "n6-b2-consolidation-capstone-2"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n6.class-97.t03",
      "en": "First, I wrote a plan; then, I checked each connector; finally, I corrected the mistakes.",
      "es": "Primero escribí un plan; luego, revisé cada conector; por último, corregí los errores.",
      "explanationEs": "First, then y finally ordenan los pasos y dan cohesión al texto.",
      "segments": [
        "First, I wrote a plan; then, I checked",
        "each connector; finally, I corrected the mistakes."
      ],
      "audioText": "First, I wrote a plan; then, I checked each connector; finally, I corrected the mistakes.",
